"description" = "beadster is a Mac app for beads, the issue tracker AI coding agents work in with bd. Choose the folder that holds your projects once; beadster finds every beads project inside it and keeps them open side by side.\n\n- Ready: the work nothing blocks, across every project, in beads' own order.\n- Needs You: gates waiting for your approval, with Approve and Reject, and beads assigned to you.\n- Agents: who claimed what, when each was last heard, and Release Now when one goes quiet.\n- Activity: every change from the last week, who made it, as it happens.\n- History: every version of a bead, and putting an earlier one back.\n- Workflows: each workflow step by step, and as a map of what waits on what.\n- Memories: what your agents remember about a project, to read and edit.\n- A change an agent makes with bd shows in beadster within a second.\n- Notifications for a gate, a quiet agent or a bead assigned to you, from the menu bar too, and every open bead in Spotlight.\n\nbeads' own code runs inside beadster, so a project reads and changes exactly as bd does. Your projects stay in their folders and nothing is uploaded.\n\nbeadster opens projects made with beads 1.0 or newer. Free.";
"keywords" = "github,jira,linear,cursor,claude,codex,manager,project,backlog,code,developer,kanban,git,workflow";
"marketingUrl" = "https://beadster.ai";
"supportUrl" = "https://beadster.ai";
"promotionalText" = "Rebuilt for beads 1.x: approve gates, watch your agents and see every change as it happens, across all your projects.";
